'''Dream Box''' (夢の箱, ''Yume no Hako'', '''Box of Dreams''') is a 2-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.7 Update|Version 11.7]] and is unlocked after completing [[Into the Future]] Chapter 1.

==Effect==
"Massive Damage" Effect UP (Sm): The effect of this ability is increased by 10%.

